# Test Cases - Vendor Payment

## 1. Purchase Order Integration

---

### VP-TC-001 - Submit Purchase Order to SAP

| Field | Details |
|---|---|
| Test Case ID | VP-TC-001 |
| Test Scenario | Verify user can submit a Purchase Order to SAP |
| Module | Vendor Payment |
| Priority | Critical |
| Test Type | Positive |
| Precondition | Final contract has been signed electronically |
| Test Data | Valid contract and PO data |

#### Test Steps

| Step | Action | Expected Result |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Open the completed contract | Contract details are displayed |
| 2 | Verify the final contract has been e-signed | Contract status is completed |
| 3 | Select the option to submit the PO to SAP | PO submission process is displayed |
| 4 | Submit the PO to SAP | PO submission is successfully processed |
| 5 | Check the PO status | PO status is updated correctly |

#### Expected Result

The Purchase Order is successfully submitted to SAP.

