| Module | SAP Integration |
| Priority | Critical |
| Test Type | Negative / Integration |
| Precondition | SAP integration is unavailable or returns an error |
| Test Data | Valid GR / SES transaction |

#### Test Steps

| Step | Action | Expected Result |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Create a valid GR / SES transaction | Transaction is created |
| 2 | Submit the GR / SES | System attempts SAP synchronization |
| 3 | Simulate or encounter SAP integration failure | Integration error occurs |
| 4 | Observe the application | Appropriate error/status is displayed |
| 5 | Check transaction data | Data is not incorrectly marked as successful |

#### Expected Result

The system handles SAP integration failure without incorrectly marking the GR / SES transaction as successful.

